pan><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Proof_Against_Poison\" title=\"Proof Against Poison\"> Proof Against Poison +6</a>:</b> This item grants its wearer immunity to natural poisons. This item also grants a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to saving throws against magical poisons, and the wearer does not fail saving throws against them on a roll of a natural 1 (this renders the wearer immune to magical poisons with a DC of less than 7 + their Fortitude save).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Assassin\" title=\"Named item sets\">Assassin</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Assassin\" title=\"Named item sets\">Assassin</a>:</b> Bonus to hit and damage with sneak attacks (+2 to hit and +5 damage from attacks considered sneak attacks[both non-stacking even if it say exceptional]), 20% less threat.  If have Assassin III Enhancement: chance with weapons to apply a Level Drain effect.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Awanahu_Sash.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Awanahu_Sash.png/420px-Awanahu_Sash.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"425\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Awanahu_Sash.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This darkened leather belt is well worn. The feared assassin, Awanahu, wore this item when he slew a powerful member of the twelve.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817200652\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2943/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21646/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6299/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n147.40%  125.833     40 Template:IO\n100.00%   85.370      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   85.370      1 -total\n 96.72%   82.569      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 49.09%   41.911      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 48.25%   41.192      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 47.33%   40.403      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 46.34%   39.562      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.48%   20.049      5 Template:Popup\n 18.58%   15.860      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11354-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817200652 and revision id 628387. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
